{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mano.dream.v2",
  "supersedes": "dialogue.mano.dream",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "ずっと続く夢の先へ（改：去掉 W.I.N.G.）",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 2,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mano.dream.v2",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mano.dream",
    "idolId": "mano",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "也没怎么和鸽子先生玩……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "但那并不代表我开始讨厌当偶像了。硬要说的话……该怎么说呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "充实……对的，我现在很充实。每天都非常开心。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，这是好事。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是的，谢谢您。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……刚才我做了个梦。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？什么样的梦？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "那个……是我开演唱会的梦。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "和灯织、巡一起，站在很大的舞台上。观众一直到很远的地方……大家都在笑。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。是个好梦。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……是的。但是——",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我站在那么大舞台上的那一天……会来吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你好像觉得那是很遥远的事。不是那样的。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真乃已经实现了很多梦想吧？当偶像时抱着的梦。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是的。我想和其他人关系更好……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "这样想着，就交到了朋友。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "想着想要更有自信。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "现在也还是迷迷糊糊的……但我开始觉得，我没问题。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "虽然还差得远……我是不是，稍微开始改变了呢……",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "何止是稍微。真乃在飞快地成长。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……是这样吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当了偶像之后，又有了\"想站上更大的舞台\"这个梦。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那一步，你也已经迈出去了。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真乃已经实现过好几个梦想了。再抱一个新的梦，不也挺好吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "至今为止的梦能实现……是因为制作人一直在我身边。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "制作人……今后也请一直和我在一起。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，当然。一起实现梦想吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "好的。下一个梦想，再下一个梦想。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我想一直和制作人一起实现……！"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……呼",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "醒了啊，真乃。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "制作人……？啊，我……",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇哇！对、对不起……不知不觉就睡着了……",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没有，来公园之后没过多久。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是吗？那太好了……不对，这也不太好……",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "第一次正式演出之后，几乎没休息过。累也是正常的。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是的……就算来公园休息，也经常迷迷糊糊的。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
